.turbo
# Forge: Pi runtime is vendored at pi/ (tracked in this repo, evolved directly).
# Build artifacts and generated data inside pi are still ignored:
.artifacts/
dist-chrome/
dist-firefox/
pi/packages/ai/src/providers/data/
pi/packages/ai/src/providers/.model-generation-*/
*.cpuprofile
# Forge: generated artifacts and local state
/src/.forge-cache/
/coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
